<title>POLAND: Investors bid for PLN 5 mln of Polish 5-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Investors bid for PLN 5 mln of Polish 5-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid to buy five million zlotys worth of Poland's 12 percent 5-year bonds, maturing October 12, 2001 at the 450 million zloty auction on Thursday, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
<p>Full details of the tender should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
